.Dd February 27, 2026
.Dt AS 1
.Os Substrate
.Sh NAME
.Nm as
.Nd Substrate assembler wrapper
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl 32 | Fl 64
.Op Fl g
.Op Fl I Ar dir
.Op Fl D Ar macro
.Op Fl march Ar cpu
.Op Fl mtune Ar cpu
.Op Fl Wa Ar opts
.Op Fl o Ar output
.Ar input.s
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
invokes a backend assembler and validates the emitted object using
.Xr libelfobj 3 .
The wrapper selects 32-bit or 64-bit mode and performs ELF sanity checks.
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width AS_BACKEND
.It Ev AS_BACKEND
Path/name of backend assembler executable. If unset,
.Nm
searches PATH.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ld 1 ,
.Xr cc 1
